--- Returns info for the current client build.
---
--- **Returns**
--- - `buildVersion`: Current patch version
--- - `buildNumber`: Build number
--- - `buildDate`: Build date
--- - `interfaceVersion`: Interface (.toc) version number
--- - `localizedVersion`: Localized description of the build version
--- - `buildInfo`: Localized build type and machine architecture
--- - `currentVersion`: Current patch version, but formatted similarly to interface version numbers (eg. "11505")
---
--- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_GetBuildInfo)
declare function GetBuildInfo(): (string, string, string, number, string, string)
--- Returns the value of one of the client's build options.
---
--- **Parameters**
--- - `name`: The option's name.
---
