--- Returns info for the mirror timer, e.g. fatigue, breath and feign death.
---
--- **Parameters**
--- - `id`: timer index, from 1 to MIRRORTIMER_NUMTIMERS (3 as of 3.2). In general, the following correspondence holds: 1 = Fatigue, 2 = Breath, 3 = Feign Death.
---
--- **Returns**
--- - `timer`: A string identifying timer type; "EXHAUSTION", "BREATH", and "FEIGNDEATH", or "UNKNOWN" indicating that the timer corresponding to that index is not currently active, and other return values are invalid.
--- - `initial`: Value of the timer when the it started.
--- - `maxvalue`: Maximum value of the timer.
--- - `scale`: Change in timer value per second.
--- - `paused`: 0 if the timer is currently running, a value greater than zero if it is not.
--- - `label`: Localized timer name.
---
--- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_GetMirrorTimerInfo)
declare function GetMirrorTimerInfo(timerIndex: number): (string?, number?, number?, number?, number?, string?, number?)
--- Returns the current value of the mirror timer.
---
--- **Parameters**
--- - `timer`: the first return value from `GetMirrorTimerInfo`, identifying the timer queried. Valid values include "EXHAUSTION", "BREATH" and "FEIGNDEATH".
