--- - `totemName`: Name of the currently active totem. If there is no active totem for this slot, this value will apparently be an empty string ("") instead of nil.
--- - `startTime`: GetTime() value of when the totem started.
--- - `duration`: Duration (in seconds) of the currently active totem.
--- - `icon`: Path to the icon of the specified totem
