--- Returns the damage stats for the unit.
---
--- **Parameters**
--- - `unit`: Likely only works for `"player"` and `"pet"`. Possibly for Beast Lore `"target"`.
---
--- **Returns**
--- - `minDamage`: The unit's minimum melee damage.
--- - `maxDamage`: The unit's maximum melee damage.
--- - `offhandMinDamage`: The unit's minimum offhand melee damage.
--- - `offhandMaxDamage`: The unit's maximum offhand melee damage. (same as above)
--- - `posBuff`: positive physical Bonus (should be >= 0)
--- - `negBuff`: negative physical Bonus (should be <= 0)
--- - `percent`: percentage modifier (usually 1; 0.9 for warriors in defensive stance)
---
--- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_UnitDamage)
