--- Returns detailed info for the threat status of one unit against another.
---
--- **Parameters**
--- - `unit`: The player or pet whose threat to request.
--- - `mobGUID`: The NPC whose threat table to query.
---
--- **Returns**
--- - `isTanking`: Returns `true` if the unit is the primary threat target of the **mobUnit**, returns `false` otherwise.
--- - `status`: Threat status of the unit on the **mobUnit**.
--- - `scaledPercentage`: The unit's threat percentage against **mobUnit**. At 100% the unit will become the primary target. This value is also scaled the closer the unit is to the mobUnit.
--- - `rawPercentage`: The unit's threat percentage against **mobUnit** relative to the threat of mobUnit's primary target. Can be greater than 100, up to 255. Stops updating when you become the primary target.
--- - `threatValue`: The unit's total threat value on the **mobUnit**.
---
--- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_UnitDetailedThreatSituation)
declare function UnitDetailedThreatSituation(unit: string, mobGUID: string): ((boolean | Secret<boolean>)?, (number | Secret<number>)?, (number | Secret<number>)?, (number | Secret<number>)?, (number | Secret<number>)?)
