--- Returns information about a PvP (honor) talent.
---
--- **Parameters**
--- - `talentID`: Talent ID.
--- - `specGroupIndex`: Index of active specialization group (`GetActiveSpecGroup`); if nil, the selected/available return values will always be false.
--- - `isInspect`: If non-nil, returns information based on inspectedUnit.
--- - `inspectedUnit`: Inspected unitId.
---
--- **Returns**
--- - `talentID`: Talent ID.
--- - `name`: Talent name.
--- - `icon`: FileID
--- - `selected`: true if the talent is chosen, false otherwise.
--- - `available`: true if the talent tier is chosen, or if it is level-appropriate for the player and the player has no talents selected in that tier, false otherwise.
--- - `spellID`: Spell ID that is added to the spellbook.
--- - `unlocked`: Whether the talent is unlocked.
--- - `row`: The row the talent is from.
--- - `column`: The column the talent is from.
--- - `known`: true if the talent is known, false otherwise.
--- - `grantedByAura`: true if the talent is granted by an aura (i.e., an effect on an item), false otherwise. The Conflict and Strife Azerite Essence uses this instead of selected.
---
--- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_GetPvpTalentInfoByID)
declare function GetPvpTalentInfoByID(talentID: number, specGroupIndex: number?, isInspect: boolean?, inspectedUnit: string?): (number, string, number, boolean, boolean, number, boolean, number, number, boolean, boolean)
