--- Returns information about a quest objective.
---
--- **Parameters**
--- - `questID`: QuestID
--- - `objectiveIndex`: Index of the quest objective to query, ascending from 1 to `GetNumQuestLeaderBoards`(questIndex) or to numObjectives from `GetTaskInfo`(questID).
--- - `displayComplete`: Pass 'true' to return as if the objective were complete. You want false generally
---
--- **Returns**
--- - `text`: Text description of the objective, e.g. "0/3 Monsters slain"
--- - `objectiveType`: A token describing objective type, one of "item", "object", "monster", "reputation", "log", "event", "player" or "progressbar".
--- - `finished`: true if sub-objective is completed, false if incomplete.
--- - `fulfilled`: quantity of the objectives completed
--- - `required`: quantity of objectives needed to finish the quest.
---
--- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_GetQuestObjectiveInfo)
