    --- *Description by wowlua: the API's documentation has none.*
    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_C_ActionBar.GetActionBarPage)
    function GetActionBarPage(): number
    --- Returns a duration object describing the active recharge time for an action.
    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_C_ActionBar.GetActionChargeDuration)
    function GetActionChargeDuration(actionID: number): LuaDurationObject
