    ---
    --- **Parameters**
    --- - `actionID`: The action slot.
    ---
    --- *Description by wowlua: the API's documentation has none.*
    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_C_ActionBar.GetActionCharges)
    function GetActionCharges(actionID: number): SpellChargeInfoSecret
    --- Returns the cooldown of the action in the slot.
    ---
    --- **Parameters**
    --- - `actionID`: The action slot.
    ---
    --- *Description by wowlua: the API's documentation has none.*
    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_C_ActionBar.GetActionCooldown)
    function GetActionCooldown(actionID: number): SpellCooldownInfoSecret
