    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_C_ActionBar.GetActionCooldownDuration)
    function GetActionCooldownDuration(actionID: number, ignoreGCD: boolean?): LuaDurationObject
    --- Depending on the action type, return a string that is either the use count or number of charges. If value is beyond the display count parameter, returns the replacementString (defaults to '*').
    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_C_ActionBar.GetActionDisplayCount)
    function GetActionDisplayCount(actionID: number, maxDisplayCount: number?, replacementString: string?): string | Secret<string>
