    function DoesEquippedArtifactHaveAnyRelicsSlotted(): boolean
    --- Returns information about a selected artifact appearance.
    ---
    --- **Parameters**
    --- - `appearanceSetIndex`: Ranging from 1 to `C_ArtifactUI.GetNumAppearanceSets`()
    --- - `appearanceIndex`: Numeric index of the appearance in the specified setIndex, from 1 to 4 -- **exception:** Set 1 for both the Feral and the Guardian Druid Artifacts, which has 7 appearances total, due to racial basic tints: Troll/Zandalari is tint 1, Tauren/Highmountain is tint 2, Night Elf is tint 3, Worgen/Kul Tiran is tint 4, and 5 to 7 for the Pillar of Creation, Light's Heart, and Campaign Effort criteria that would otherwise be index 2 to 4. Querying racial tints other than the one for the current character's race returns nil.
    ---
    --- **Returns**
    --- - `artifactAppearanceID`: ArtifactAppearanceID
    --- - `appearanceName`: The name of the artifact weapon this appearance goes to
    --- - `displayIndex`: The index of this appearance in its set, the same as the appearanceIndex that was entered
    --- - `unlocked`: Whether this appearance has been unlocked
    --- - `failureDescription`: The requirements for unlocking this appearance. Will return nil for the artifact's base appearance
    --- - `swatchColorR`: The red component of the appearance swatch button, between 0 and 1
    --- - `swatchColorG`: The green component of the appearance swatch button, between 0 and 1
    --- - `swatchColorB`: The red component of the appearance swatch button, between 0 and 1
    --- - `modelOpacity`: The alpha level (opacity) of the weapon in the Artifact UI, defaulted to 0.5
    --- - `modelSaturation`: The saturation level (brightness) of the weapon in the Artifact UI, defaulted to 0.5
    --- - `obtainable`: Whether the artifact's animation is being suppressed, defaulted to false
    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_C_ArtifactUI.GetAppearanceInfo)
    function GetAppearanceInfo(appearanceSetIndex: number, appearanceIndex: number): (number?, string?, number?, boolean?, string?, number?, number?, number?, number?, number?, number?, number?, boolean?)
    --- Returns information about a selected artifact appearance.
    ---
    --- **Parameters**
    --- - `artifactAppearanceID`: ArtifactAppearanceID
    ---
    --- **Returns**
    --- - `artifactAppearanceSetID`: The appearance set this appearance belongs to (from C_ArtifactUI.GetAppearanceSetInfo)
    --- - `artifactAppearanceID`: ArtifactAppearanceID
    --- - `appearanceName`: The name of the artifact weapon this appearance goes to
    --- - `displayIndex`: The index of this appearance in its set, the same as the appearanceIndex that was entered
    --- - `unlocked`: Whether this appearance has been unlocked
    --- - `failureDescription`: The requirements for unlocking this appearance. Will return nil for the artifact's base appearance
    --- - `swatchColorR`: The red component of the appearance swatch button, between 0 and 1
    --- - `swatchColorG`: The green component of the appearance swatch button, between 0 and 1
    --- - `swatchColorB`: The red component of the appearance swatch button, between 0 and 1
    --- - `modelOpacity`: The alpha level (opacity) of the weapon in the Artifact UI, defaulted to 0.5
    --- - `modelSaturation`: The saturation level (brightness) of the weapon in the Artifact UI, defaulted to 0.5
    --- - `obtainable`: Whether the artifact's animation is being suppressed, defaulted to false
