    --- *Description by wowlua: the API's documentation has none.*
    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_C_ChatInfo.ResetDefaultZoneChannels)
    function ResetDefaultZoneChannels()
    --- Sends a message over an addon comm channel.
    ---
    --- **Parameters**
    --- - `prefix`: Message prefix, can be used as your addon identifier; at most 16 characters.
    --- - `message`: Text to send, at most 255 characters. All characters (decimal ID 1-255) are permissible except NULL (ASCII 0).
    --- - `chatType`: The addon channel to send to.
    --- - `target`: The player name or custom channel number receiving the message for `"WHISPER"` or `"CHANNEL"` chatTypes.
    ---
    --- **Returns**
    --- - `result`: Result code indicating if the message has been enqueued by the API for submission. This does not mean that the message has yet been sent, and may still be subject to any server-side throttling.
    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_C_ChatInfo.SendAddonMessage)
    function SendAddonMessage(prefix: string, message: string, chatType: string?, target: string?): SendAddonMessageResult
    --- Sends a text payload to other clients specified by chatChannel and target which are registered to listen for prefix. Intended for plain text payloads; logged and throttled.
    ---
    --- **Parameters**
    --- - `chatType`: ChatType, defaults to SLASH_CMD_PARTY.
    --- - `target`: Only applies for targeted channels
    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_C_ChatInfo.SendAddonMessageLogged)
    function SendAddonMessageLogged(prefix: string, message: string, chatType: string?, target: string?): SendAddonMessageResult?
    --- Sends a chat message that was held back for the player to confirm.
    ---
    --- **Parameters**
    --- - `confirmNumber`: The held message's number.
    ---
    --- *Description by wowlua: the API's documentation has none.*
    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_C_ChatInfo.SendCautionaryChatMessage)
    function SendCautionaryChatMessage(confirmNumber: number)
    --- Sends a chat message.
    ---
    --- **Parameters**
    --- - `chatType`: Chat type string ('SAY', 'EMOTE', etc.). Defaults to 'SAY' if not specified.
    --- - `languageID`: Language to send the message in.
    --- - `target`: Name of the player to send a message to. Only applies to chat types that support targeted messages.
    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_C_ChatInfo.SendChatMessage)
    function SendChatMessage(message: string, chatType: SendChatMessageType?, languageID: number?, target: (string | number)?)
    --- Swaps two chat channels' numbers in the player's channel list.
    ---
    --- **Parameters**
    --- - `firstChannelIndex`: The channel's number in the player's channel list.
