    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_C_EncounterTimeline.AddScriptEvent)
    function AddScriptEvent(eventInfo: EncounterTimelineScriptEventRequest): EncounterTimelineEventID
    --- Cancels all custom timeline events, removing them from the timeline.
    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_C_EncounterTimeline.CancelAllScriptEvents)
    function CancelAllScriptEvents()
    --- Removes all Edit Mode events from the timeline.
    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_C_EncounterTimeline.CancelEditModeEvents)
    function CancelEditModeEvents()
    --- Cancels a custom timeline event, removing it from the timeline.
    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_C_EncounterTimeline.CancelScriptEvent)
    function CancelScriptEvent(eventID: EncounterTimelineEventID)
    --- Finishes a custom timeline event, removing it from the timeline.
    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_C_EncounterTimeline.FinishScriptEvent)
    function FinishScriptEvent(eventID: EncounterTimelineEventID)
    --- Returns the current timestamp used for rendering the timeline display.
    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_C_EncounterTimeline.GetCurrentTime)
    function GetCurrentTime(): DurationSeconds
    --- Returns the current color used to render timeline event.
    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_C_EncounterTimeline.GetEventColor)
    function GetEventColor(eventID: EncounterTimelineEventID, overrideTrigger: EncounterEventColorTrigger?): ColorMixin | Secret<ColorMixin>
    --- Returns the number of present events in the timeline by their source type.
    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_C_EncounterTimeline.GetEventCountBySource)
    function GetEventCountBySource(source: EncounterTimelineEventSource): number
    --- Returns the duration at which timeline events will be highlighted for imminency.
    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_C_EncounterTimeline.GetEventHighlightTime)
    function GetEventHighlightTime(): DurationSeconds
    --- Returns information about a timeline event. This data is generally expected to be static for the lifetime of an event.
    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_C_EncounterTimeline.GetEventInfo)
    function GetEventInfo(eventID: EncounterTimelineEventID): EncounterTimelineEventInfoSecret
    --- Returns an unsorted list of event IDs present in the timeline.
    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_C_EncounterTimeline.GetEventList)
    function GetEventList(): EncounterTimelineEventID[]
    --- Returns the current state of a timeline event.
    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_C_EncounterTimeline.GetEventState)
    function GetEventState(eventID: EncounterTimelineEventID): EncounterTimelineEventState
    --- Returns the elapsed duration of a timeline event.
    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_C_EncounterTimeline.GetEventTimeElapsed)
    function GetEventTimeElapsed(eventID: EncounterTimelineEventID): DurationSeconds
    --- Returns the remaining duration of a timeline event.
    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_C_EncounterTimeline.GetEventTimeRemaining)
    function GetEventTimeRemaining(eventID: EncounterTimelineEventID): DurationSeconds
    --- Returns a Duration object that tracks the elapsed duration of a timeline event. This object tracks the range [0, duration] of the event and automatically pauses its progression based on event state.
    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_C_EncounterTimeline.GetEventTimer)
    function GetEventTimer(eventID: EncounterTimelineEventID): LuaDurationObject?
    --- Returns information about the position of an event on the timeline.
    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_C_EncounterTimeline.GetEventTrack)
    function GetEventTrack(eventID: EncounterTimelineEventID): (EncounterTimelineTrack, number?)
    --- Returns a sorted list of event IDs present in the timeline from shortest to longest remaining durations, meeting the requirements of the specified filters.
    ---
    --- **Parameters**
    --- - `maxEventCount`: Maximum number of sorted events to return.
    --- - `maxEventDuration`: Maximum duration of sorted events to return.
    --- - `excludeTerminalStates`: If false, include events that are terminal states such as Canceled or Finished.
    --- - `excludeHiddenEvents`: If false, include events that should be hidden by user configuration, such as events on long tracks when the user has opted to not show long countdowns.
    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_C_EncounterTimeline.GetSortedEventList)
    function GetSortedEventList(maxEventCount: number?, maxEventDuration: DurationSeconds?, excludeTerminalStates: boolean?, excludeHiddenEvents: boolean?): EncounterTimelineEventID[]
    --- Returns information for a single timeline track.
    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_C_EncounterTimeline.GetTrackInfo)
    function GetTrackInfo(track: EncounterTimelineTrack): EncounterTimelineTrackInfo
    --- Returns information about all timeline tracks.
    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_C_EncounterTimeline.GetTrackList)
    function GetTrackList(): EncounterTimelineTrackInfo[]
    --- Returns the maximum permitted event duration on a single timeline track.
    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_C_EncounterTimeline.GetTrackMaxEventDuration)
    function GetTrackMaxEventDuration(track: EncounterTimelineTrack): DurationSeconds
    --- Returns the type of a single timeline track.
    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_C_EncounterTimeline.GetTrackType)
    function GetTrackType(track: EncounterTimelineTrack): EncounterTimelineTrackType
    --- Returns the current view type of the timeline.
    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_C_EncounterTimeline.GetViewType)
    function GetViewType(): EncounterTimelineViewType
    --- Returns true if the timeline contains any events in the active state.
    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_C_EncounterTimeline.HasActiveEvents)
    function HasActiveEvents(): boolean
    --- Returns true if the timeline contains any events in any state.
    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_C_EncounterTimeline.HasAnyEvents)
    function HasAnyEvents(): boolean
    --- Returns true if the timeline contains any events in the paused state.
    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_C_EncounterTimeline.HasPausedEvents)
    function HasPausedEvents(): boolean
    --- Returns true if the timeline contains any events that are on visible tracks.
    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_C_EncounterTimeline.HasVisibleEvents)
    function HasVisibleEvents(): boolean
    --- Returns true if the event is in a 'blocked' state, where the cast for this event may not occur due to encounter conditions not being met.
    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_C_EncounterTimeline.IsEventBlocked)
    function IsEventBlocked(eventID: EncounterTimelineEventID): boolean
    --- Returns true if the encounter timeline feature is available on this client.
    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_C_EncounterTimeline.IsFeatureAvailable)
    function IsFeatureAvailable(): boolean
    --- Returns true if the encounter timeline feature has been enabled by the player. This function will always return false if the feature is not available.
    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_C_EncounterTimeline.IsFeatureEnabled)
    function IsFeatureEnabled(): boolean
    --- Pauses a custom timeline event, hiding it from the timeline. A paused event can later be resumed to show it again, or canceled.
    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_C_EncounterTimeline.PauseScriptEvent)
    function PauseScriptEvent(eventID: EncounterTimelineEventID)
    --- Resumes a custom timeline event, showing it on the timeline again if it is currently paused.
    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_C_EncounterTimeline.ResumeScriptEvent)
    function ResumeScriptEvent(eventID: EncounterTimelineEventID)
    --- Updates a given vector of texture objects to reference art assets for icons associated with an event.
    ---
    --- **Parameters**
    --- - `includeIcons`: Mask to apply to candidate icons. Any icon bits not present in this set will not be assigned to textures.
    --- - `textures`: Array of texture objects to update. This will change the assigned atlases and alpha values of the region, applying secret aspects to protect the data.
    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_C_EncounterTimeline.SetEventIconTextures)
    function SetEventIconTextures(eventID: EncounterTimelineEventID, includeIcons: EncounterEventIconmask, textures: Texture[])
    --- Changes the view type for the timeline. This adjusts track layouts to be more appropriate for a specific mode and optimizes event processing.
    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_C_EncounterTimeline.SetViewType)
    function SetViewType(viewType: EncounterTimelineViewType)
end

declare namespace C_EncounterWarnings
    --- Returns the color that encounter warnings of the given severity are shown in.
    ---
    --- *Description by wowlua: the API's documentation has none.*
    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_C_EncounterWarnings.GetColorForSeverity)
    function GetColorForSeverity(severity: EncounterEventSeverity): ColorMixin
    --- Returns the sample encounter warning that Edit Mode shows for the given severity.
    ---
    --- *Description by wowlua: the API's documentation has none.*
    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_C_EncounterWarnings.GetEditModeWarningInfo)
    function GetEditModeWarningInfo(severity: EncounterEventSeverity): EncounterWarningInfo
    --- Returns true if custom sound alerts are allowed to play for hidden warning messages.
    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_C_EncounterWarnings.GetPlayCustomSoundsWhenHidden)
    function GetPlayCustomSoundsWhenHidden(): boolean
    --- Returns the sound kit ID played for encounter warnings of the given severity.
    ---
    --- *Description by wowlua: the API's documentation has none.*
    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_C_EncounterWarnings.GetSoundKitForSeverity)
    function GetSoundKitForSeverity(severity: EncounterEventSeverity): number
    --- Returns true if text messages for encounter events are allowed to be shown.
    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_C_EncounterWarnings.GetWarningsShown)
    function GetWarningsShown(): boolean
    --- Whether encounter warnings are available.
    ---
    --- *Description by wowlua: the API's documentation has none.*
    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_C_EncounterWarnings.IsFeatureAvailable)
    function IsFeatureAvailable(): boolean
    --- Whether encounter warnings are turned on.
    ---
    --- *Description by wowlua: the API's documentation has none.*
    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_C_EncounterWarnings.IsFeatureEnabled)
    function IsFeatureEnabled(): boolean
    --- Plays the encounter warning sound for the given severity and returns its sound handle.
    ---
    --- *Description by wowlua: the API's documentation has none.*
    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_C_EncounterWarnings.PlaySound)
    function PlaySound(severity: EncounterEventSeverity): number?
    --- Controls whether custom sound alerts for encounter events are allowed to play for warning messages that are hidden.
    ---
    --- **Parameters**
    --- - `play`: If true, allow playing custom sound alerts. Note that sound alerts will not be played if the encounter warnings feature has been disabled.
    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_C_EncounterWarnings.SetPlayCustomSoundsWhenHidden)
    function SetPlayCustomSoundsWhenHidden(play: boolean)
    --- Controls whether text messages for encounter events are allowed to be shown.
    ---
    --- **Parameters**
    --- - `shown`: If false, hides all warning messages in the default UI.
    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_C_EncounterWarnings.SetWarningsShown)
    function SetWarningsShown(shown: boolean)
end

