    --- <!-- or , , , , --> Retrieves information about work orders for specified building.
    ---
    --- **Returns**
    --- - `name`: The localized name of the building, as listed on the Garrison Landing Page
    --- - `texture`: FileID - The texture for the building, as listed on the Garrison Landing Page
    --- - `shipmentCapacity`: Total number of work orders the Herb Garden is currently capable of.
    --- - `shipmentsReady`: Number of shipements ready to be picked up.
    --- - `shipmentsTotal`: Total number of shipments that are ready and/or pending.
    --- - `creationTime`: Time work orders were created, in timestamp format.
    --- - `duration`: The time it takes for each work order to complete.
    --- - `timeleftString`: Time left for the next shipment to complete.
    --- - `itemName`: The localized name of the work order type, e.g. "Garden" for the Herb Garden work orders. Used as the tooltip title for building on the Landing Page.
    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_C_Garrison.GetLandingPageShipmentInfo)
