    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_C_HousingBlueprint.ExportBlueprint)
    function ExportBlueprint(type: HousingBlueprintType, name: string)
    --- Saves out a new Blueprint of the specified room, using the specified name, if available (see `C_HousingBlueprint.GetExportAvailability`); Listen for `HOUSING_BLUEPRINT_EXPORT_SUCCESS` and `HOUSING_BLUEPRINT_EXPORT_FAILURE` for results
    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_C_HousingBlueprint.ExportRoomBlueprint)
