    function GetBlueprintHyperlink(blueprintShareCode: string): string?
    --- Returns what type of Blueprint the specified code is for; Will return HousingBlueprintType.None if code is invalid; Does NOT check whether the shareCode actually matches up to a real valid Blueprint
    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_C_HousingBlueprint.GetBlueprintTypeForCode)
    function GetBlueprintTypeForCode(shareCode: string): HousingBlueprintType
