    --- *Description by wowlua: the API's documentation has none.*
    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_C_HousingBlueprint.UpdateBlueprintStringFromInput)
    function UpdateBlueprintStringFromInput(inputShareCode: string): string?
end

