    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_C_MountJournal.GetMountFromItem)
    function GetMountFromItem(itemID: number): number?
    --- Returns the mount for a spell ID.
    ---
    --- **Returns**
    --- - `mountID`: MountID
    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_C_MountJournal.GetMountFromSpell)
    function GetMountFromSpell(spellID: SpellIdentifier | Secret<SpellIdentifier>): number?
    --- Returns the IDs of mounts listed in the mount journal.
    ---
    --- **Returns**
    --- - `mountIDs`: MountID
    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_C_MountJournal.GetMountIDs)
    function GetMountIDs(): number[]
    --- Returns information about the specified mount.
    ---
    --- **Parameters**
    --- - `mountID`: MountID - Returned from `C_MountJournal.GetMountIDs`()
    --- - `displayIndex`: Index of the displayed mount in the mount journal list with the current search query and filters. Ranging from 1 to `C_MountJournal.GetNumDisplayedMounts`()
    ---
    --- **Returns**
    --- - `name`: The name of the mount.
    --- - `spellID`: The ID of the spell that summons the mount.
    --- - `icon`: Icon texture used by the mount.
    --- - `isActive`: Indicates if the player is currently mounted on the mount.
    --- - `isUsable`: Indicates if the mount is usable based on the player's current location, riding skill, profession skill, class, etc.
    --- - `sourceType`: Indicates generally how the mount may be obtained; a localized string describing the acquisition method is returned by `C_MountJournal.GetMountInfoExtraByID`.
    --- - `isFavorite`: Indicates if the mount is currently marked as a favorite.
    --- - `isFactionSpecific`: true if the mount is only available to one faction, false otherwise.
    --- - `faction`: 0 if the mount is available only to Horde players, 1 if the mount is available only to Alliance players, or nil if the mount is not faction-specific.
    --- - `shouldHideOnChar`: Indicates if the mount should be hidden in the player's mount journal (includes Swift Spectral Gryphon and mounts specific to the opposite faction).
    --- - `isCollected`: Indicates if the player has learned the mount.
    --- - `mountID`: ID of the mount.
    --- - `isSteadyFlight`: true if mount supports only steady flight.
    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_C_MountJournal.GetMountInfoByID)
    function GetMountInfoByID(mountID: number): (string?, number?, number?, boolean?, boolean?, number?, boolean?, boolean?, PvPFaction?, boolean?, boolean?, number?, boolean?)
    --- Returns extra information about the specified mount.
    ---
    --- **Parameters**
    --- - `mountID`: MountID - Returned from `C_MountJournal.GetMountIDs`()
    --- - `displayIndex`: Index of the displayed mount in the mount journal list with the current search query and filters. Ranging from 1 to `C_MountJournal.GetNumDisplayedMounts`()
    ---
    --- **Returns**
    --- - `creatureDisplayInfoID`: DisplayID - If `nil`, then the mount has multiple displayIDs, from `C_MountJournal.GetMountAllCreatureDisplayInfoByID`()https://www.townlong-yak.com/framexml/8.1.5/Blizzard_Collections/Blizzard_MountCollection.lua#206. This is not consistent however, since this can be not nil and still have multiple displayIds.
    --- - `description`: flavor text describing the mount
    --- - `source`: information about how the mount is obtained, including vendor name and location, monetary cost, etc.
    --- - `isSelfMount`: true if the player transforms into the mount (eg. Obsidian Nightwing or Sandstone Drake), or false for normal mounts
    --- - `mountTypeID`: a number indicating the capabilities of the mount; known values include:
    --- - `uiModelSceneID`: ModelSceneID
    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_C_MountJournal.GetMountInfoExtraByID)
    function GetMountInfoExtraByID(mountID: number): (number?, string?, string?, boolean?, number?, number?, number?, number?, boolean?)
