    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_C_MountJournal.IsValidTypeFilter)
    function IsValidTypeFilter(filterIndex: number): boolean
    --- Whether a mount is new and not yet seen.
