declare namespace C_PetBattles
    --- Returns the rarity of a specific pet in the current pet battle.
    ---
    --- **Parameters**
    --- - `slot`: Accepted values are 1-3, but the order is based off of the initial order. Which pet is currently active is irrelevant to the index, if it was your 3rd pet when you entered battle, it will always be 3 on the index.
    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_C_PetBattles.GetBreedQuality)
    function GetBreedQuality(petOwner: BattlePetOwner, slot: number): BattlePetBreedQuality
    --- Returns the current icon of a specific pet in the pet battle.
    ---
    --- **Parameters**
    --- - `slot`: Accepted values are 1-3, but the order is based off of the initial order. Which pet is currently active is irrelevant to the index, if it was your 3rd pet when you entered battle, it will always be 3 on the index.
    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_C_PetBattles.GetIcon)
    function GetIcon(petOwner: BattlePetOwner, slot: number): number?
    --- Returns the name(s) of a specific pet in the pet battle.
    ---
    --- **Parameters**
    --- - `slot`: Accepted values are 1-3, but the order is based off of the initial order. Which pet is currently active is irrelevant to the index, if it was your 3rd pet when you entered battle, it will always be 3 on the index.
    ---
    --- **Returns**
    --- - `customName`: Name of the pet. If the pet has a custom name, it will be returned here. If not, it returns the species name here as well as in the second return.
    --- - `speciesName`: Name of the pet's Species.
    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_C_PetBattles.GetName)
    function GetName(petOwner: BattlePetOwner, slot: number): (string?, string?)
    --- Returns whether or not a pet battle team is controlled by an NPC.
    ---
    --- **Parameters**
    --- - `petOwner`: 1: Current player, 2: Opponent.
    ---
    --- **Returns**
    --- - `isNPC`: false if the pet owner is a player, true otherwise.
    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_C_PetBattles.IsPlayerNPC)
    function IsPlayerNPC(): boolean
    --- Returns whether or not there is a wild pet battle in progress.
    ---
    --- **Returns**
    --- - `inWildBattle`: True if in a wild pet battle, false if not in a wild pet battle or not in a pet battle at all
    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_C_PetBattles.IsWildBattle)
    function IsWildBattle(): boolean
