    --- **Returns**
    --- - `canAccept`: true if the player can currently accept the queued PvP pet battle match invitation, false otherwise.
    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_C_PetBattles.CanAcceptQueuedPVPMatch)
    function CanAcceptQueuedPVPMatch(): boolean
    --- Returns whether or not the active pet can be swapped out in the pet battle.
    ---
    --- **Returns**
