    --- Returns the effect info for a pet's ability.
    ---
    --- **Parameters**
    --- - `abilityID`: The ID of this ability.
    --- - `turnIndex`: The turn in question for this ability. This can be obtained from `C_PetBattles.GetAbilityProcTurnIndex`.
    --- - `effectIndex`: The effect in question for this ability. This can be obtained from the unparsed description for this ability with extensive string manipulation, but currently no ability has more than 7 effects, so loops work too.
    --- - `effectName`: One of the effect names from `C_PetBattles.GetAllEffectNames`.
    ---
    --- **Returns**
    --- - `value`: The information you requested for a specific element of a certain effect of a certain ability at a specific turn.
    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_C_PetBattles.GetAbilityEffectInfo)
    function GetAbilityEffectInfo(abilityID: number, turnIndex: number, effectIndex: number, effectName: string): number
    --- Returns ability information for an ability in a slot on a pet that you own.
    ---
    --- **Parameters**
    --- - `petOwner`: 1: Current player, 2: Opponent
    --- - `petIndex`: Accepted values are 1-3, but the order is based off of the initial order. Which pet is currently active is irrelevant to the index, if it was your 3rd pet when you entered battle, it will always be 3 on the index.
    --- - `abilityIndex`: Accepted values are 1-3, corresponding to the ability in the slot with that number.
    ---
    --- **Returns**
    --- - `id`: The ID of the ability returned back.
    --- - `name`: The name of the ability.
    --- - `icon`: The full path to the ability's icon.
    --- - `maxCooldown`: The normal cooldown period for the ability.
    --- - `unparsedDescription`: The ability's description in its pure and unparsed form.
    --- - `numTurns`: Duration of the ability. This is typically 1, but some abilities last multiple rounds.
    --- - `petType`: Returned values are 1-10, based on the pet's type.
    --- - `noStrongWeakHints`: True if the ability should not show Strong/Weak indicators, false otherwise.
    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_C_PetBattles.GetAbilityInfo)
    function GetAbilityInfo(petOwner: number, petIndex: number, abilityIndex: number): (number, string, string, number, string, number, number, boolean)
    --- Returns very detailed information about a specific ability.
    ---
    --- **Parameters**
    --- - `id`: ID of the ability.
    ---
    --- **Returns**
    --- - `id`: The ID of the ability returned back.
    --- - `name`: The name of the ability.
    --- - `icon`: The full path to the ability's icon.
    --- - `maxCooldown`: The normal cooldown period for the ability.
    --- - `unparsedDescription`: The ability's description in its pure and unparsed form.
    --- - `numTurns`: Duration of the ability. This is typically 1, but some abilities last multiple rounds.
    --- - `petType`: Returned values are 1-10, based on the
    --- - `noStrongWeakHints`: True if the ability should not show Strong/Weak indicators, false otherwise.
    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_C_PetBattles.GetAbilityInfoByID)
    function GetAbilityInfoByID(id: number): (number, string, string, number, string, number, number, boolean)
    --- Returns the turn index for a specific ability and proc type.
