    --- - `owned`: Whether the pet is owned by the player
    --- - `customName`: Name assigned by the player or nil if unnamed
    --- - `level`: The pet's current battle level
    --- - `favorite`: Whether the pet is marked as a favorite
    --- - `isRevoked`: True if the pet is `C_PetJournal.PetIsRevoked`; false otherwise.
    --- - `speciesName`: Name of the pet species ("Albino Snake", "Blue Mini Jouster", etc.)
    --- - `icon`: Full path for the species' icon
    --- - `petType`: Index of the species' petType.
    --- - `companionID`: NPC ID for the summoned companion pet.
    --- - `tooltip`: Section of the tooltip that provides location information
    --- - `description`: Section of the tooltip that provides pet description ("flavor text")
    --- - `isWild`: True if the pet was/can be caught in the wild, false otherwise.
    --- - `canBattle`: True if this pet can be used in battles, false otherwise.
    --- - `isTradeable`: True if this pet can be traded, false otherwise.
    --- - `isUnique`: True if this pet is unique, false otherwise.
    --- - `obtainable`: True if this pet can be obtained, false otherwise (only false for tamer pets and developer/test pets).
