    --- Plays a sound kit. Returns whether it played, and a handle to the sound.
    ---
    --- **Parameters**
    --- - `soundKitID`: Sound Kit ID in . Sounds used in FrameXML are defined in the SOUNDKIT table.
    --- - `uiSoundSubType`: Sound channel to play this file on.
    --- - `forceNoDuplicates`: Do not play the sound when it is already playing.
    --- - `overridePriority`: A priority that overrides the sound kit's own.
    --- - `runFinishCallback`: Fire `SOUNDKIT_FINISHED` when the sound ends.
    --- - `volumeOverride`: A volume that overrides the sound kit's own.
    ---
    --- *Description by wowlua: the API's documentation has none.*
    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_C_Sound.PlaySound)
