    --- Returns a duration object describing the active loss of control cooldown duration for a spellbook item.
    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_C_SpellBook.GetSpellBookItemLossOfControlCooldownDuration)
    function GetSpellBookItemLossOfControlCooldownDuration(spellBookItemSlotIndex: number, spellBookItemSpellBank: SpellBookSpellBank): LuaDurationObject?
    --- Returns nil if item doesn't exist or if this kind of item doesn't display cooldowns (ex: future or offspec spells)
    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_C_SpellBook.GetSpellBookItemLossOfControlCooldownInfo)
    function GetSpellBookItemLossOfControlCooldownInfo(spellBookItemSlotIndex: number, spellBookItemSpellBank: SpellBookSpellBank): SpellLossOfControlInfoSecret?
    --- Returns the name of a spellbook item.
    ---
    --- **Parameters**
    --- - `spellBookItemSlotIndex`: Spellbook slot index, ranging from 1 through the total number of spells across all tabs and pages
    ---
    --- **Returns**
    --- - `name`: Name of the spell as it appears in the spell book, e.g. *"Lesser Heal"*
    --- - `subName`: May be empty if spell's data isn't loaded yet; Listen for `SPELL_TEXT_UPDATE` event, or use SpellMixin to load asynchronously
