    function IsSpellBookItemHarmful(spellBookItemSlotIndex: number, spellBookItemSpellBank: SpellBookSpellBank): boolean
    --- Returns true if the SpellBookIem can be cast on the player or other friendly targets
    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_C_SpellBook.IsSpellBookItemHelpful)
    function IsSpellBookItemHelpful(spellBookItemSlotIndex: number, spellBookItemSpellBank: SpellBookSpellBank): boolean
    --- Returns true if the current target is within range of the SpellBookIem; False if out of range; Nil if range check was invalid
    ---
