    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_C_SpellBook.IsSpellBookItemInRange)
    function IsSpellBookItemInRange(spellBookItemSlotIndex: number, spellBookItemSpellBank: SpellBookSpellBank, targetUnit: string?): boolean?
    --- Returns true if the SpellBookItem belongs to a non-active class specialization
    ---
