    function IsSpellBookItemOffSpec(spellBookItemSlotIndex: number, spellBookItemSpellBank: SpellBookSpellBank): boolean
    --- Returns true if the SpellBookItem is a passive spell; Will always return false if it is not a spell
    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_C_SpellBook.IsSpellBookItemPassive)
    function IsSpellBookItemPassive(spellBookItemSlotIndex: number, spellBookItemSpellBank: SpellBookSpellBank): boolean
    --- Returns whether the SpellBookItem is currently castable; Typically based on things like learned status, required resources, etc
    ---
    --- **Parameters**
    --- - `spellBookItemSlotIndex`: Spellbook slot index, ranging from 1 through the total number of spells across all tabs and pages
    ---
    --- **Returns**
    --- - `isUsable`: True if the spell is usable, false otherwise. A spell might be unusable for a variety of reasons, such as:
    --- - `insufficientPower`: True if SpellBookItem is specifically unusable due to insufficient power (i.e., MANA, RAGE, etc)
    ---
