    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_C_Spell.GetAuraStatChanges)
    function GetAuraStatChanges(spellID: number): (number, PowerTypeChange[])
    --- Returns the ID of the base spell that the given spell overrides, or the spell's own ID when it overrides none.
    ---
    --- **Parameters**
    --- - `spec`: Which Class Specialization to consider, as overrides may vary by Spec; Defaults to player's current Spec
    --- - `spellIdentifier`: The spell's ID or name.
    ---
    --- **Returns**
    --- - `baseSpellID`: Returns the spellID passed in if there is no override
    ---
    --- *Description by wowlua: the API's documentation has none.*
    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_C_Spell.GetBaseSpell)
    function GetBaseSpell(spellIdentifier: SpellIdentifier | Secret<SpellIdentifier>, spec: number?): number
    --- Returns information about the given spell as a deadly debuff.
