    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_C_StringUtil.EscapeQuotedCodes)
    function EscapeQuotedCodes(text: string | Secret<string>): stringView
    --- Returns the number rounded down to a whole number, as text.
    ---
    --- *Description by wowlua: the API's documentation has none.*
    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_C_StringUtil.FloorToNearestString)
