declare event AUCTION_HOUSE_THROTTLED_MESSAGE_SENT()
--- Fires when the auction house can accept requests again after throttling. Blizzard's sell frames update their post button.
---
--- *Description by wowlua: the API's documentation has none.*
declare event AUCTION_HOUSE_THROTTLED_SYSTEM_READY()
--- Fires when posting several auctions of an item at once stops because of a failure. Blizzard's item sell frame ends its multisell state.
