--- - `questID`: The quest.
---
--- *Description by wowlua: the API's documentation has none.*
declare event PLAYER_INSIDE_QUEST_BLOB_STATE_CHANGED(questID: number, isInside: boolean)
--- Fires when the server answers an attempt to apply mount equipment. Blizzard's mount journal shows the result.
