---
--- *Description by wowlua: the API's documentation has none.*
declare event MOUNT_EQUIPMENT_APPLY_RESULT(success: boolean)
--- Fires when the results of the mount journal's search change. Blizzard's mount list redraws.
---
--- *Description by wowlua: the API's documentation has none.*
declare event MOUNT_JOURNAL_SEARCH_UPDATED()
--- Fires when which mounts the player can use changes. Blizzard's mount journal redraws.
---
--- *Description by wowlua: the API's documentation has none.*
declare event MOUNT_JOURNAL_USABILITY_CHANGED()
--- Fires when the player learns a new mount.
---
--- **Parameters**
