declare event SPELL_DATA_LOAD_RESULT(spellID: number, success: boolean)
--- Used in conjunction with EnableSpellRangeCheck to inform the UI when a spell goes in or out of range with the current target.
---
--- **Parameters**
--- - `isInRange`: Whether or not the current target is in range of the spell. Should not be used if the 'checksRange' parameter is false.
--- - `checksRange`: Can be false if a range check was not made for any reason, for example there is not a current target.
declare event SPELL_RANGE_CHECK_UPDATE(spellIdentifier: SpellIdentifier, isInRange: boolean, checksRange: boolean)
--- Fires when a spell's description text has been updated. Blizzard's frames redraw tooltips for that spell.
