--- *Description by wowlua: the API's documentation has none.*
declare event PLAYER_ENTERING_WORLD(isInitialLogin: boolean, isReloadingUi: boolean)
--- Fires when the player leaves the world, before a loading screen or logout. `PLAYER_ENTERING_WORLD` follows once the player is back in the world.
