--- *Description by wowlua: the API's documentation has none.*
declare event PLAYER_LEAVING_WORLD()
--- Fires once after login, when the addons that load at startup have loaded and the player is available. Blizzard loads the time manager and combat log on it; `PLAYER_ENTERING_WORLD` follows.
---
--- *Description by wowlua: the API's documentation has none.*
